<title>USA: Footstar Feb oper same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Footstar Feb oper same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	    $119.4    $107.6	    + 11.0	+ 6.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is four weeks ended March 1.</p>
<p>Full company name is Footstar Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE:  Footstar was spun off from CVS Corp, formerly known as Melville Corp, in October 1996.  Its Tom McCann operations were no longer considered part of the company's sales from continuing operations, the company said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
